        "body": "Adds a new property called `scrollBuffer`, which can be added to the various `bottom-sheet` scrollable views.  It changes functionality so that the bottom sheet doesn't track the user's finger unless the scrollable view's position is past the specified `scrollBuffer`.\r\n",
